  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity India: Infrastructure Loan Fund - TA (Design) is a component of India: Infrastructure Loan Fund - Small loans to bridge the infrastructure gap for the poor reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;275,958. It works in the following sector(s): Agricultural services, Road transport, Water supply and sanitation - large systems, Energy generation, renewable sources - multiple technologies.</narrative>
